---
title: Contact | Woven Nutrition
description: Contact Woven Nutrition to schedule your free introductory call. In-person in Seattle and virtual throughout Washington State.
layout: layouts/base.njk
---
    <div class="page-hero">
      <h1>Contact Us</h1>
    </div>

    <section class="contact-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="contact-grid">

          <div>
            <p style="color:var(--text-light); margin-bottom:2rem;">Please use the calendar below to schedule your introductory call.</p>

            <div class="scheduling-box">
              <p>If you select a Monday, Wednesday, or Friday appointment time, you will be connected with Nicole.</p>
              <p>If you select a Tuesday or Thursday appointment time, you will be connected with Anna. If you are contacting us through Prime Sports Institute, we advise that you select a Tuesday or Thursday appointment time if possible.</p>
              <p>If you have any difficulty scheduling through Calendly or would like to contact us directly, please reach out to <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:2rem;">
              <div class="contact-detail">
                <div class="contact-icon">📍</div>
                <div class="contact-detail-text">
                  <strong>Address</strong>
                  {{ site.address.line1 }}<br>{{ site.address.line2 }}
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="contact-detail">
                <div class="contact-icon">✉️</div>
                <div class="contact-detail-text">
                  <strong>Email</strong>
                  <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="contact-detail">
                <div class="contact-icon">🌐</div>
                <div class="contact-detail-text">
                  <strong>Service Area</strong>
                  We offer in-person nutrition counseling in Seattle, as well as virtual counseling throughout Washington State.
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="contact-cta">
              <h3>Schedule Your Introductory Call</h3>
              <p>Book your free 15-minute introductory call through our scheduling portal.</p>
              <a href="{{ site.portalUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-white">Book Now</a>
            </div>

            <div style="background:var(--cream); border-radius:8px; padding:28px; margin-top:24px;">
              <h3 style="font-size:1.1rem; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Existing Clients</h3>
              <p style="font-size:0.9rem; color:var(--text-light); margin-bottom:1rem;">Access your secure client portal to manage appointments and connect with your dietitian.</p>
              <a href="{{ site.portalUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn-primary" style="font-size:0.82rem; padding:11px 22px;">Client Portal</a>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
